1
00:00:06,320 --> 00:00:08,280
♪Beneath the mask♪

2
00:00:08,760 --> 00:00:12,480
♪Lies another mask♪
(Original Story: Haishi Lisheng)

3
00:00:12,880 --> 00:00:15,320
♪Who's sincere♪

4
00:00:15,640 --> 00:00:19,200
♪Who's only pretending♪

5
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:21,800
♪Borrowing your light♪

6
00:00:22,040 --> 00:00:26,360
♪I walk through my own night♪

7
00:00:27,160 --> 00:00:28,080
♪You are my weakness♪

8
00:00:28,520 --> 00:00:29,720
♪And my weapon too♪

9
00:00:30,040 --> 00:00:31,200
♪Draped in your shadow♪

10
00:00:31,560 --> 00:00:33,200
♪I walk the blade's edge♪

11
00:00:33,560 --> 00:00:34,880
♪If one day♪

12
00:00:35,240 --> 00:00:36,640
♪The mask shatters♪

13
00:00:36,920 --> 00:00:38,000
♪Will you still♪

14
00:00:38,480 --> 00:00:42,480
♪Recognize my light♪

15
00:00:42,480 --> 00:00:44,480
=The Masked Lover=

16
00:00:55,640 --> 00:00:56,799
It was fine yesterday.

17
00:00:57,079 --> 00:00:59,320
Why is the rice spoiled today?

18
00:00:59,479 --> 00:01:01,039
It's yesterday's leftovers.

19
00:01:01,039 --> 00:01:02,359
The Fourteenth Concubine said

20
00:01:02,359 --> 00:01:04,120
expenses at the Governor's Residence
have been too high lately,

21
00:01:04,120 --> 00:01:05,560
so we need to cut back.

22
00:01:07,560 --> 00:01:08,400
I'm not eating this.

23
00:01:08,599 --> 00:01:09,319
Water.

24
00:01:09,319 --> 00:01:10,400
At least there's hot water, right?

25
00:01:10,560 --> 00:01:11,599
I want hot water.

26
00:01:11,599 --> 00:01:12,879
Boiling water uses firewood too.

27
00:01:12,879 --> 00:01:14,000
The Fourteenth Concubine was kind enough

28
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:15,959
to send you an extra quilt.

29
00:01:15,959 --> 00:01:17,680
If you're cold,

30
00:01:17,760 --> 00:01:18,719
just bundle up in it.

31
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:19,519
You...

32
00:01:44,840 --> 00:01:46,439
Que'er, you vile little maid!

33
00:01:48,920 --> 00:01:51,719
My fate today will be yours tomorrow!

34
00:02:01,120 --> 00:02:03,800
=Episode 14=

35
00:02:17,759 --> 00:02:18,840
How's the security setup?

36
00:02:18,840 --> 00:02:19,960
We booked the entire floor.

37
00:02:19,960 --> 00:02:21,879
Every room has been thoroughly searched.

38
00:02:32,400 --> 00:02:34,919
This is the hotel's finest suite,

39
00:02:35,080 --> 00:02:36,560
reserved for Young Master Rong.

40
00:02:36,800 --> 00:02:38,759
Our men are in both adjoining rooms.

41
00:02:39,479 --> 00:02:40,560
Nothing can go wrong.

42
00:02:43,120 --> 00:02:44,840
Put someone in the room

43
00:02:45,199 --> 00:02:46,560
directly below this one too.

44
00:02:46,919 --> 00:02:48,319
Keep someone under the window 24/7.

45
00:02:49,360 --> 00:02:50,159
Yes.

46
00:02:50,680 --> 00:02:52,360
Commander He, you think of everything.

47
00:03:18,800 --> 00:03:19,599
It's you?

48
00:03:20,039 --> 00:03:21,240
I know.

49
00:03:21,240 --> 00:03:23,879
You were hoping Commander He would come.

50
00:03:24,400 --> 00:03:25,400
Unfortunately,

51
00:03:25,919 --> 00:03:27,680
Father gave him an important assignment.

52
00:03:27,800 --> 00:03:29,080
He has no time for you.

53
00:03:30,560 --> 00:03:31,840
"Father" this, "Father" that.

54
00:03:31,960 --> 00:03:33,439
You sound awfully affectionate.

55
00:03:33,439 --> 00:03:35,560
Have you forgotten you're a fake?

56
00:03:36,200 --> 00:03:37,020
Oh, come on.

57
00:03:37,639 --> 00:03:40,919
Why are you so obsessed
with whether I'm real?

58
00:03:41,360 --> 00:03:42,400
I know the truth.

59
00:03:42,759 --> 00:03:45,319
You don't actually care
whether I'm real or not.

60
00:03:45,800 --> 00:03:48,080
You just like Commander He,

61
00:03:48,199 --> 00:03:49,599
so you can't stand me.

62
00:03:54,680 --> 00:03:56,080
Stop waiting.

63
00:03:56,080 --> 00:03:57,360
He's not coming to save you.

64
00:04:00,599 --> 00:04:02,280
But I can.

65
00:04:02,639 --> 00:04:04,400
You'd really be that kind?

66
00:04:05,039 --> 00:04:06,759
Lady Feng.

67
00:04:06,759 --> 00:04:08,479
You've got me all wrong.

68
00:04:09,120 --> 00:04:10,479
You like Commander He.

69
00:04:10,479 --> 00:04:11,599
I don't.

70
00:04:11,800 --> 00:04:13,280
We're hardly mortal enemies.

71
00:04:15,439 --> 00:04:18,439
But I did expose you
to the old man before.

72
00:04:18,920 --> 00:04:20,040
So,

73
00:04:20,600 --> 00:04:21,920
I won't save you for nothing.

74
00:04:21,920 --> 00:04:23,560
You need to agree to
one condition first.

75
00:04:25,639 --> 00:04:26,439
What condition?

76
00:04:37,040 --> 00:04:38,160
You're crazy.

77
00:04:38,160 --> 00:04:39,360
That's too dangerous.

78
00:04:43,560 --> 00:04:48,160
Is your situation now
any less dangerous?

79
00:04:50,040 --> 00:04:51,680
It's only a suggestion.

80
00:04:52,279 --> 00:04:54,000
If you don't want to do it,

81
00:04:54,120 --> 00:04:55,360
I'll be going.

82
00:04:59,839 --> 00:05:00,639
Wait.

83
00:05:01,519 --> 00:05:02,399
I'll do it.

84
00:05:03,160 --> 00:05:04,000
I agree.

85
00:05:04,000 --> 00:05:05,120
I'll do it.

86
00:05:07,519 --> 00:05:08,360
Good.

87
00:05:08,360 --> 00:05:09,319
Wait for my word.

88
00:05:21,920 --> 00:05:23,959
Mom, I want another one.

89
00:05:24,839 --> 00:05:25,360
Okay.

90
00:05:25,360 --> 00:05:25,680
Good girl.

91
00:05:25,680 --> 00:05:27,000
I'll buy you another.

92
00:05:27,759 --> 00:05:28,240
Thanks, Mom.

93
00:05:28,240 --> 00:05:28,879
Stop the car.

94
00:05:33,120 --> 00:05:34,399
(Candy for sale!)

95
00:05:34,839 --> 00:05:36,279
(Come take a look, kids!)

96
00:05:37,560 --> 00:05:39,279
(Sweet, delicious candy!)

97
00:05:39,959 --> 00:05:41,279
(Get yourself a couple!)

98
00:05:42,360 --> 00:05:44,240
(Mom, I want this one.)

99
00:05:45,079 --> 00:05:46,040
(All right.)

100
00:05:46,040 --> 00:05:46,759
(I'll get it for you.)

101
00:05:47,199 --> 00:05:48,160
(Two candies, please.)

102
00:05:48,600 --> 00:05:49,800
(Which two do you want?)

103
00:05:50,839 --> 00:05:51,519
(This one.)

104
00:05:51,519 --> 00:05:52,399
(And this one.)

105
00:05:52,399 --> 00:05:53,199
(Sure.)

106
00:05:54,160 --> 00:05:54,959
(Here you go.)

107
00:05:56,319 --> 00:05:56,720
(Here.)

108
00:05:56,720 --> 00:05:57,480
(Thank you.)

109
00:05:58,920 --> 00:06:00,399
We'll just get two today.

110
00:06:00,560 --> 00:06:01,480
Remember,

111
00:06:01,560 --> 00:06:03,680
save them for when life
feels unbearable.

112
00:06:04,560 --> 00:06:05,839
Okay, Mom.

113
00:06:10,920 --> 00:06:12,959
(Once,)

114
00:06:12,959 --> 00:06:15,279
(when life felt unbearable,)

115
00:06:15,560 --> 00:06:16,759
(someone gave me a piece of candy too.)

116
00:06:17,600 --> 00:06:18,240
One of each.

117
00:06:18,240 --> 00:06:18,879
To go.

118
00:06:24,079 --> 00:06:25,319
I have to admit,

119
00:06:25,319 --> 00:06:27,000
you have a good head for business.

120
00:06:27,279 --> 00:06:29,160
Far better than that worthless son.

121
00:06:29,279 --> 00:06:32,120
I can trust you with the chamber.

122
00:06:32,399 --> 00:06:33,639
It's all thanks to you, Father.

123
00:06:33,639 --> 00:06:34,879
Don't be modest.

124
00:06:36,160 --> 00:06:38,600
A fine father raises a fine daughter.

125
00:06:40,120 --> 00:06:41,079
Now, business.

126
00:06:41,319 --> 00:06:45,120
Young Master Rong will visit
the chamber in a few days.

127
00:06:45,560 --> 00:06:47,920
Show him around properly.

128
00:06:48,560 --> 00:06:49,759
Don't worry, Father.

129
00:06:50,120 --> 00:06:52,360
I'll show him the Lu family's power
in Fancheng.

130
00:06:54,120 --> 00:06:54,920
Father, watch out!

131
00:07:06,240 --> 00:07:07,240
Lu Zhentian!

132
00:07:07,519 --> 00:07:09,000
I'm taking you down with me!

133
00:07:09,199 --> 00:07:10,480
You have a death wish!

134
00:07:19,680 --> 00:07:21,360
(Gentle Breezes Bring Harmony)

135
00:07:25,199 --> 00:07:26,000
Yutang.

136
00:07:27,920 --> 00:07:28,800
You're hurt.

137
00:07:30,000 --> 00:07:30,839
Father.

138
00:07:30,839 --> 00:07:31,800
I'm just glad you weren't hurt.

139
00:07:32,079 --> 00:07:33,040
Governor.

140
00:07:33,240 --> 00:07:34,079
Get the army doctor.

141
00:07:34,360 --> 00:07:35,120
Governor.

142
00:07:35,120 --> 00:07:36,079
Have you forgotten?

143
00:07:36,240 --> 00:07:37,600
Dr. Liang fled,

144
00:07:38,120 --> 00:07:39,279
and his replacement hasn't arrived.

145
00:07:39,839 --> 00:07:40,639
Father.

146
00:07:40,959 --> 00:07:42,480
I'll just get treated at the hospital.

147
00:07:43,759 --> 00:07:45,240
Take this witch

148
00:07:45,360 --> 00:07:46,399
and drown her in the river.

149
00:07:53,800 --> 00:07:56,639
(Governor's Residence)

150
00:07:56,639 --> 00:07:57,439
Wait.

151
00:07:59,439 --> 00:08:00,879
Tie her up and put her in the car.

152
00:08:00,879 --> 00:08:02,560
The hospital is right by the river.

153
00:08:02,720 --> 00:08:04,720
I'll dump her after I'm treated.

154
00:08:05,040 --> 00:08:06,000
Yes, Ms. Lu.

155
00:08:15,240 --> 00:08:16,040
Ms. Lu.

156
00:08:18,040 --> 00:08:18,600
Let's go.

157
00:08:18,600 --> 00:08:19,199
Yes.

158
00:08:27,879 --> 00:08:28,800
Ms. Lu.

159
00:08:29,199 --> 00:08:30,480
Go to the second floor for my medicine.

160
00:08:30,720 --> 00:08:31,360
I'll wait in the car.

161
00:08:31,360 --> 00:08:32,240
Yes, Ms. Lu.

162
00:08:52,080 --> 00:08:52,960
Su Yutang.

163
00:08:52,960 --> 00:08:53,960
You're incredible.

164
00:08:54,000 --> 00:08:55,360
I saw you with my own eyes

165
00:08:55,440 --> 00:08:57,799
grab Iron Leopard's gun and fire at me.

166
00:08:58,279 --> 00:08:59,320
When did you switch it?

167
00:09:00,039 --> 00:09:01,720
There are eyes everywhere.

168
00:09:02,559 --> 00:09:04,879
So you'd better play dead properly.

169
00:09:07,840 --> 00:09:08,639
So...

170
00:09:08,639 --> 00:09:09,919
That witch treating me like that...

171
00:09:10,399 --> 00:09:11,559
You told her to do it?

172
00:09:12,279 --> 00:09:14,120
You set it up so taking him down with me

173
00:09:14,120 --> 00:09:17,960
today would seem perfectly natural.

174
00:09:19,159 --> 00:09:20,600
Can the corpse keep it down?

175
00:09:20,679 --> 00:09:21,200
You're noisy.

176
00:09:41,600 --> 00:09:42,639
Where are we?

177
00:09:42,639 --> 00:09:44,039
Didn't you say you'd let me go?

178
00:09:44,039 --> 00:09:45,799
Su Yutang, untie me!

179
00:09:48,480 --> 00:09:49,799
This is why I call you stupid.

180
00:09:49,799 --> 00:09:51,679
You believe everything I say?

181
00:09:57,799 --> 00:10:01,279
Last time, I fired it
at my best friend in the world.

182
00:10:02,240 --> 00:10:03,639
It was supposed to be a magic trick,

183
00:10:04,720 --> 00:10:06,039
but she died.

184
00:10:07,799 --> 00:10:08,960
This time,

185
00:10:09,200 --> 00:10:11,840
I fired it at someone
as annoying as you.

186
00:10:12,440 --> 00:10:13,679
Another magic trick,

187
00:10:14,639 --> 00:10:16,519
yet somehow you survived.

188
00:10:19,720 --> 00:10:20,960
Like I said,

189
00:10:21,840 --> 00:10:23,639
life really isn't fair.

190
00:10:28,080 --> 00:10:30,159
What exactly did you tie me up for?

191
00:10:30,559 --> 00:10:31,720
I want the truth.

192
00:10:34,639 --> 00:10:35,879
What truth?

193
00:10:38,240 --> 00:10:42,000
I took this straight
from Lu Zhentian's waist.

194
00:10:42,240 --> 00:10:43,039
It's real.

195
00:10:45,440 --> 00:10:47,559
He thinks I fired one shot.

196
00:10:48,200 --> 00:10:49,279
So logically,

197
00:10:49,279 --> 00:10:51,519
one round should be missing.

198
00:10:55,360 --> 00:10:57,320
If you don't tell me the truth,

199
00:10:58,679 --> 00:11:00,720
I can't promise

200
00:11:01,000 --> 00:11:02,360
where this bullet will land.

201
00:11:04,639 --> 00:11:06,639
I knew you weren't that kind!

202
00:11:06,639 --> 00:11:07,399
Help!

203
00:11:09,879 --> 00:11:11,080
That's all the nerve you have?

204
00:11:11,200 --> 00:11:12,720
Yet you still scheme against people?

205
00:11:13,399 --> 00:11:14,080
Talk.

206
00:11:14,399 --> 00:11:16,200
Why does He Jingchen
care so much about you?

207
00:11:18,039 --> 00:11:18,840
Because...

208
00:11:20,039 --> 00:11:23,200
I saved his life.

209
00:11:26,440 --> 00:11:27,399
Go on.

210
00:11:27,960 --> 00:11:30,480
When, where, and how did you save him?

211
00:11:41,879 --> 00:11:43,320
We'll just get two today.

212
00:11:43,559 --> 00:11:44,559
Remember,

213
00:11:44,559 --> 00:11:46,679
save them for when life
feels unbearable.

214
00:11:47,440 --> 00:11:48,600
Okay, Mom.

215
00:11:49,080 --> 00:11:51,360
(If she really joined forces with me)

216
00:11:51,759 --> 00:11:53,279
(to avenge the real Ms. Lu,)

217
00:11:54,559 --> 00:11:56,559
(then during her time here,)

218
00:11:57,080 --> 00:11:58,320
(has she been living)

219
00:11:58,960 --> 00:12:00,200
(a life of hardship,)

220
00:12:00,919 --> 00:12:02,679
(or one of wealth and privilege?)

221
00:12:03,559 --> 00:12:05,080
Commander He, bad news!

222
00:12:07,159 --> 00:12:10,480
Ms. Lu killed Lady Feng!

223
00:12:13,000 --> 00:12:15,800
(Gentle Breezes Bring Harmony)

224
00:12:29,600 --> 00:12:33,960
♪A lie carved deep into the heart♪
(Loyalty Eternal)

225
00:12:35,520 --> 00:12:38,600
♪Blades clash, leaving us both trapped♪

226
00:12:38,960 --> 00:12:41,760
♪Nightmares from days gone by♪

227
00:12:43,040 --> 00:12:44,280
♪Love and hate intertwine♪

228
00:12:44,720 --> 00:12:48,640
♪In eyes ignited by sparks♪

229
00:12:49,280 --> 00:12:54,600
♪Each blooming with a fierce edge♪

230
00:12:56,520 --> 00:12:59,320
♪Shattering moonlight on the ground♪

231
00:12:59,920 --> 00:13:02,800
♪I look up and meet your gaze♪

232
00:13:03,240 --> 00:13:05,120
♪Unveiling all the absurdity♪

233
00:13:05,440 --> 00:13:08,360
♪Seeking love's only truth♪

234
00:13:08,840 --> 00:13:15,040
♪Through fate's layered maze♪

235
00:13:15,600 --> 00:13:18,640
♪Charging toward the unknown♪

236
00:13:19,120 --> 00:13:21,840
♪Don't forget your stubborn heart♪

237
00:13:22,280 --> 00:13:28,360
♪Fire tempers the strength to go on♪

238
00:13:28,920 --> 00:13:31,760
♪Counting down the long night's haze♪

239
00:13:32,200 --> 00:13:35,080
♪With my own hands, I draw the dawn♪

240
00:13:35,500 --> 00:13:37,920
♪Boundless♪
